# Enforces this repo's own declared end_of_line = lf (../../.editorconfig)
# at checkout time, on every platform. Without this, Git for Windows'
# default core.autocrlf=true (in effect on GitHub-hosted windows-latest
# runners, where this project's CI actually builds/tests) silently rewrites
# these LF-committed files to CRLF during `actions/checkout@v4` -- which
# then fails `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` with ENDOFLINE errors
# before a single test runs, despite the files being correctly formatted
# in the repository itself.
* text=auto eol=lf
